1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
This tiny gadget actually surprised me for once.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:08,100
I expected nothing and somehow got even less.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:12,200
This feels expensive until you touch the buttons.

4
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:16,300
That little sound just destroyed all my confidence.

5
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:20,400
The packaging clearly received the entire design budget.

6
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:24,500
Watch this part because things get weird fast.

7
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:28,600
Apparently the instruction manual believes in second chances.

8
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:32,700
Nobody warned me about this extremely dramatic button.

9
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:36,800
The handle looks stronger than my life choices.

10
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:40,900
That is either brilliant engineering or pure luck.

11
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,000
This thing has absolutely no reason to wobble.

12
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:49,100
Somehow the cheapest part is doing the work.

13
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:53,200
My expectations were low but this went lower.

14
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:57,300
That tiny screw is carrying this entire project.

15
00:00:57,400 --> 00:01:01,400
The result looks suspiciously better than the advertisement.

16
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:05,500
Please tell me that noise was completely intentional.

17
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:09,600
We have officially entered the experimental phase now.

18
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:13,700
This is where confidence becomes a dangerous hobby.

19
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:17,800
That little upgrade actually makes a huge difference.

20
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:21,900
The instructions skipped several extremely important emotional stages.

21
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Even the camera seems embarrassed by this design.

22
00:01:26,100 --> 00:01:30,100
I would call that a very expensive surprise.

23
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:34,200
This looks simple until your hands get involved.

24
00:01:34,300 --> 00:01:38,300
One more twist and everything should finally work.

25
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:42,400
That is not the improvement I was expecting.

26
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:46,500
The final result actually deserves a second look.

27
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:50,600
This tiny detail changes the entire experience completely.

28
00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:54,700
Somebody definitely tested this under very different conditions.

29
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:58,800
It works perfectly if you ignore that part.

30
00:01:58,900 --> 00:02:02,900
Honestly this turned out much better than expected.